  ask: 'how do I let the player shoot back?',
  file: 'Assets/Scripts/PlayerProjectile.cs',
  label: 'In the Code',
  intro:
    'A new script on the cloned prefab, and one new method on the player. The bullet moves itself; the player only decides the direction and pays the cooldown. One line is left for you — the hand-off.',
